{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07334","headline":"晚次湖口有怀 · 刘长卿","name":"晚次湖口有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霭然空水合，目极平江暮。\n南望天无涯，孤帆落何处。\n顷爲衡湘客，颇见湖山趣。\n朝气和楚云，夕阳映江树。\n帝乡劳想望，万里心来去。\n白发生扁舟，沧波满归路。\n秋风今已至，日夜雁南度。\n木叶辞洞庭，纷纷落无数。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}